# Template images directory
# Place meme template images here with the following naming convention:
# - {template-id}.jpg - Full size image
# - {template-id}-thumb.jpg - Thumbnail image
#
# Required templates:
# - drake.jpg / drake-thumb.jpg
# - distracted-boyfriend.jpg / distracted-boyfriend-thumb.jpg
# - two-buttons.jpg / two-buttons-thumb.jpg
# - change-my-mind.jpg / change-my-mind-thumb.jpg
# - one-does-not-simply.jpg / one-does-not-simply-thumb.jpg
